{% extends 'privacy_page/base.html.twig' %}
{# revisionNotFound: bool, disabled: bool, reason: PrivacyPolicyUnavailableReason|null #}
{% block title %}No privacy policy{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{% if revisionNotFound %}
<h1>Revision not found</h1>
<p>This instance has no privacy policy revision with that number.</p>
{% elseif disabled|default(false) %}
<h1>No privacy policy</h1>
<p>The privacy policy is disabled on this FetchDock instance by its operator.</p>
<p>Ask the operator of this instance if you have questions about how it handles your data.</p>
{% else %}
<h1>No privacy policy published</h1>
<p>This FetchDock instance currently publishes no privacy policy.</p>
{% if reason.value == 'integrity_modified' %}
<p>FetchDock generates the policy from its own code, and only publishes it while the instance can show that it runs unmodified FetchDock. The last check found files that differ from the official build, so the generated text might not describe what this instance does.</p>
{% elseif reason.value == 'integrity_unknown' %}
<p>FetchDock generates the policy from its own code, and only publishes it while the instance can show that it runs unmodified FetchDock. The instance could not verify its code recently, for example because it is offline or runs a build that is not an official release.</p>
{% elseif reason.value == 'not_published' %}
<p>The operator has not reviewed and published this instance's privacy policy yet.</p>
{% else %}
<p>The operator has not completed the information the policy needs yet.</p>
{% endif %}
<p>Ask the operator of this instance how it handles your data.</p>
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
